  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rhino &amp; Tiger Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to deter poaching activity at Sungai Yu Tiger Corridor and encroachment into Taman Negara; elicit reliable information on crimes against wildlife from the public to aid law enforcement; and cultivate wildlife stewardship among the Malaysian public. This will be done by (1) placing citizen volunteers at encroachment hotspots and on the Taman Negara border, especially on weekends and public holidays when enforcement staff are often not on duty; (2) having volunteers actively seek snares and traps and deactivate them while carrying out recreational activities or border maintenance work; and (3) having volunteers report suspicious activity to the Wildlife Crime Hotline.</narrative>
  </description>
